@startuml IGshorts_Data_Ranking_Pipeline
title IGshorts — Data Ingestion & Ranking Pipeline

skinparam backgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam defaultFontColor #1F2937
skinparam roundCorner 12
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.6
skinparam ArrowFontColor #334155
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
skinparam activityBorderColor #3B82F6
skinparam activityFontColor #1E3A8A
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #F59E0B
skinparam activityDiamondFontColor #78350F
skinparam partitionBorderColor #CBD5E1
skinparam partitionFontColor #0F172A
skinparam partitionFontStyle bold
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #ECFDF5
skinparam noteBorderColor #10B981
skinparam noteFontColor #065F46
skinparam legendBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam legendBorderColor #E2E8F0

|Editorial Ops|
start
:Maintain **Creator Watchlist**
(username · niche · state/metro);
:Publish **News** + hashtag ticker items;
:Optional **Editorial Boost**
(feature / correct ranks);

|Scheduler|
:EventBridge triggers sync
(every 6–12 hours);

|Ingestion Worker|
:Load due watchlist batch
(respect Meta rate limits);
:Call **Meta Graph API**
Business Discovery / Hashtag Search;

if (API success?) then (yes)
  :Normalize profile & media metrics;
  :Write **MetricSnapshot** to PostgreSQL;
else (retry / skip)
  :Log failure · backoff · alert;
  stop
endif

|Scoring Engine|
:Compute **IGshorts Score**
followers_norm
+ engagement_rate
+ growth_30d
+ reel_velocity
+ editorial_boost
+ region_relevance;
:Store score on snapshot;

|Chart Builder|
:Rank within
**India / Region / Category**;
:Build Top-N chart entries
with ↑↓ vs previous period;
:Refresh **Redis** hot charts
+ ticker payloads;

|Public Website|
:Serve charts via API / SSR;
:Users browse Top-10,
regions, news, methodology;

stop

legend right
  |= Stage |= Owner |
  | Editorial Ops | Content team |
  | Scheduler / Worker | Engineering |
  | Scoring / Charts | Engineering |
  | Public Website | Product |
endlegend

note right
  **Important**
  We do **not** scrape Instagram.
  Pipeline is watchlist + Meta-compliant APIs
  + editorial enrichment.
end note

@enduml
